// French cognate data — French <-> English (with an Italian bridge) look-alikes.
// Mirrors data/cognates.js exactly, with `french` replacing `italian`:
//   {french, english, chinese, patternType, similarityScore, difficulty, rank}
// Additive fields: partOfSpeech, gender, falseFriend, lookalike, warning,
//   italian / italianSimilarity / italianPatternType, similarityBasis,
//   patternNote (reason when patternType is null), source, chineseSource,
//   semanticGate (pass|fail|unknown — 见下).
// similarityBasis='english' -> similarityScore compares french vs english;
// similarityBasis='lookalike' (faux amis) -> it compares french vs the trap word.
//
// 中文释义的优先级链（2026 修：不再无条件走英语跳板）：
//   1. 手写 faux-amis 表 / 手写覆盖表 ....... chineseSource 以 authored 开头
//   2. data/french-vocabulary.js（课程整理词表）
//   3. data/french-vocabulary-glossary.js（教材总词汇表）
//   4. ECDICT 英语跳板，且必须通过语义闸门（法语词的真实义与英语 look-alike
//      的 ECDICT 义至少共享一个义项）；闸门不过又没有权威中文兜底的直接删
//   5. 都拿不到可靠中文的条目直接删掉（宁可少给，不要给错）
// Sources: Lexique 3.83 (CC BY-SA 4.0), Wiktionary/Wiktextract (CC BY-SA 3.0),
//   ECDICT-derived data/english-vocabulary.js, hand-authored faux-amis table,
//   in-repo French textbook glossaries (authoritative FR->ZH layer).
// Rebuild: python3 scripts/build_french_extras.py            (整表重建，需要联网缓存)
//          python3 scripts/build_french_extras.py --only cognate-glosses  (只重跑释义层)
// Total entries: 4269 (faux amis: 135)

